language design-core version 0.5.
channel ActionCalls.
contract ActionCallsProtocol.
scenario ActionCompleted.
contract ActionCompletion.
unit ActionEngine.
contract ActionInvocation.
field ActionName.
unit ActionReloader.
message ActionRequest.
message ActionResult.
field ActionRevision.
field ActionSequence.
unit ActionSourceWatcher.
actor ApplicationDeveloper.
functionality BindUiEventsToActions.
field CompletedAction.
field CompletedRevision.
field CompletedSequence.
usecase ExecuteTypedAction.
mode Executing.
activity ExistingCapability.
activity IndependentPackaging.
functionality InstallCompatibleActionModel.
functionality InvokeRegisteredHandler.
functionality ObserveActionCandidates.
capability RegisteredDomainExecution.
interface RegisteredGoHandlerPort.
interface SduiSessionPort.
feature TypedActionExecution.
unit UiBindingBridge.
ActionCalls upholds ActionCallsProtocol.
ActionCallsProtocol has completeness = closed.
ActionCallsProtocol permits ActionRequest.
ActionCallsProtocol permits ActionResult.
ActionCompleted exercises ExecuteTypedAction.
ActionCompleted has completeness = closed.
ActionCompleted illustrates ExistingCapability.
ActionCompleted runs-in Executing.
ActionCompleted step 1 sends ActionRequest from UiBindingBridge to ActionEngine via ActionCalls.
ActionCompleted step 2 sends ActionResult from ActionEngine to UiBindingBridge via ActionCalls reply-to 1.
ActionCompletion has completeness = closed.
ActionCompletion has-field CompletedAction.
ActionCompletion has-field CompletedRevision.
ActionCompletion has-field CompletedSequence.
ActionEngine consumes RegisteredGoHandlerPort.
ActionEngine owns InvokeRegisteredHandler.
ActionEngine provides RegisteredDomainExecution.
ActionEngine uses ActionCalls as receiver of ActionRequest in mode Executing.
ActionEngine uses ActionCalls as sender of ActionResult in mode Executing.
ActionInvocation has completeness = closed.
ActionInvocation has-field ActionName.
ActionInvocation has-field ActionRevision.
ActionInvocation has-field ActionSequence.
ActionName has presence = required.
ActionName has value-type = text.
ActionReloader owns InstallCompatibleActionModel.
ActionRequest has message-kind = request.
ActionRequest upholds ActionInvocation.
ActionResult has message-kind = result.
ActionResult replies-to ActionRequest.
ActionResult upholds ActionCompletion.
ActionRevision has presence = required.
ActionRevision has value-type = unsigned.
ActionSequence has presence = required.
ActionSequence has value-type = unsigned.
ActionSourceWatcher owns ObserveActionCandidates.
ApplicationDeveloper pursues ExecuteTypedAction.
BindUiEventsToActions contributes-to TypedActionExecution.
BindUiEventsToActions realizes RegisteredDomainExecution.
CompletedAction has presence = required.
CompletedAction has value-type = text.
CompletedRevision has presence = required.
CompletedRevision has value-type = unsigned.
CompletedSequence has presence = required.
CompletedSequence has value-type = unsigned.
ExistingCapability addresses BindUiEventsToActions.
ExistingCapability addresses InstallCompatibleActionModel.
ExistingCapability addresses InvokeRegisteredHandler.
ExistingCapability addresses ObserveActionCandidates.
ExistingCapability delivers TypedActionExecution.
ExistingCapability has implementation-status = implemented.
IndependentPackaging has implementation-status = planned.
InstallCompatibleActionModel contributes-to TypedActionExecution.
InstallCompatibleActionModel realizes RegisteredDomainExecution.
InvokeRegisteredHandler contributes-to TypedActionExecution.
InvokeRegisteredHandler realizes RegisteredDomainExecution.
ObserveActionCandidates contributes-to TypedActionExecution.
ObserveActionCandidates realizes RegisteredDomainExecution.
RegisteredDomainExecution requires RegisteredGoHandlerPort in mode Executing.
RegisteredDomainExecution requires SduiSessionPort in mode Executing.
TypedActionExecution supports ExecuteTypedAction.
UiBindingBridge consumes SduiSessionPort.
UiBindingBridge owns BindUiEventsToActions.
UiBindingBridge uses ActionCalls as receiver of ActionResult in mode Executing.
UiBindingBridge uses ActionCalls as sender of ActionRequest in mode Executing.
